{"pageid":860,"title":"King Palm","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">King Palm</span>","revid":14476,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">King Palm</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Big_palm.png/revision/latest?cb=20230630015817\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Big palm\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Big_palm.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230630015817\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Big_palm.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230630015817 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dc/Big_palm.png/revision/latest?cb=20230630015817 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Big palm\" width=\"270\" height=\"425\" data-image-key=\"Big_palm.png\" data-image-name=\"Big palm.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">planked</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$1.35/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$7/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$8.75/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.11.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">June 26th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nThe <b>King Palm</b> tree can be found near the beach alongside it's smaller and lighter <a href=\"/wiki/Palm\" title=\"Palm\">palm</a> tree. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>It sells for less than <a href=\"/wiki/Oak\" title=\"Oak\">Oak</a> and it's <a href=\"/wiki/Palm\" title=\"Palm\">smaller counterpart</a>, so selling King Palm isn't the best way to make money. Sanding King Palm is difficult, as the trunk is often so large that the player will have to cut it into smaller pieces in order to be able to sand it.\n</p><p>Once cut down, you can sell the log for <b>$1.5 per stud.</b> If you use the saw or a sander, you will create the sanded version of the wood which sells for <b>$7 per stud.</b> You can also use a Planker to get the <b>Planked</b> version, which sells for <b>$8.75 per stud.</b>\n</p><p>Like any other material in the game, you can use logs, sanded, and planked King Palm to complete <b>schematics</b>.\n</p><p>You can find bananas on King Palms. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The difference between the King Palm and the <a href=\"/wiki/Palm\" title=\"Palm\">Palm</a> is that the King Palm has a darker and more desaturated log.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:King Palm (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6S2luZ19QYWxtP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel